ruption in the Red Zone is such a pain. If I were a little further away from you, I wouldn't be able to tell which signal is yours, will I?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"UMP9Mod","expression":2,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,-50"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"UMP9","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"That's true... So does that mean we might end up not recognizing Squad Ferrum when we're supposed to link up with them later?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"RO635Mod","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"RO635","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Relax, we have a code."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4 SOPMOD IIMod","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4 SOPMOD II","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"That's RO for you! "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Come on 9, let's go look for clues around here!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"UMP9Mod","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,-50"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"UMP9","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Sure."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"UMP9 winks at UMP45, who gestures for her to not go too far. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Right now, only UMP45 and RO635 are here."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"RO635Mod","expression":2,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_keyboardtype_sci","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":"RO635","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"45, I've gone over the readings again. I still think our current data is accurate. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"However, the intermittent signal means that a part of it wasn't recorded."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"UMP45Mod","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"UMP45","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Hm, if you keep simulating, you'll be able to extrapolate the unrecorded data. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"So what should we do now? Should we wait to meet up with Squad Ferrum or continue pursuit?"}]}]},{"